  "claim": "This national competition in Russia crowned Julia Alexandrovna Kourotchkina. Sofia Nikitchuk was crowned with the title in 2015. This competition is the same type of competition as Miss Cape Verde.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Julia Kourotchkina. Sentence: Julia Alexandrovna Kourotchkina \"(Russian: Юлия Александровна Курочкина, or Yuliya Aleksandrovna Kurochkina \"; born 10 August 1974 in Shcherbinka, Russia) is a Russian actress, model and beauty queen who was crowned Miss Russia 1992 and later crowned Miss World 1992 in Sun City, South Africa.\nPage: Miss Russia. Sentence: Miss Russia (Russian: Мисс Россия) is a national Beauty pageant in Russia.\nPage: Sofia Nikitchuk. Sentence: Sofia Viktorovna Nikitchuk (Russian: София Викторовна Никитчук ; born 20 October 1993) is a Russian actress, model and beauty pageant titleholder who was crowned Miss Russia 2015 and represented her country at the Miss World 2015 pageant.\nPage: Miss Cape Verde. Sentence: Miss Cape Verde is a national Beauty pageant in Cape Verde.",
  "evidence_text": "Page: Julia Kourotchkina. Sentence: Julia Alexandrovna Kourotchkina \"(Russian: Юлия Александровна Курочкина, or Yuliya Aleksandrovna Kurochkina \"; born 10 August 1974 in Shcherbinka, Russia) is a Russian actress, model and beauty queen who was crowned Miss Russia 1992 and later crowned Miss World 1992 in Sun City, South Africa.\nPage: Miss Russia. Sentence: Miss Russia (Russian: Мисс Россия) is a national Beauty pageant in Russia.\nPage: Sofia Nikitchuk. Sentence: Sofia Viktorovna Nikitchuk (Russian: София Викторовна Никитчук ; born 20 October 1993) is a Russian actress, model and beauty pageant titleholder who was crowned Miss Russia 2015 and represented her country at the Miss World 2015 pageant.\nPage: Miss Cape Verde. Sentence: Miss Cape Verde is a national Beauty pageant in Cape Verde.",
